<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four stocks fell and two rose in 0.8-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday turnover was at 1.8 million zlotys.</p>
<p>The remaining nine stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose in a 19.3-million zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
